Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Recommends: xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-23
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver metapackage (GeForce 6/7 series (NV4x, G7x))
 The 304.137 driver from the NVIDIA 304xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for jammy.
 .
 Supported hardware: GeForce 6/7 series (NV4x, G7x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2017-09. Kernel module forward-ported to Linux ~7.2 (import flydiscohuebr/nvidia-304 + adapt 390xx patches). X driver needs the private xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-23 (video ABI 23). See docs/legacy-feasibility.md.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2204: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (23). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump,
 nvidia-persistenced and the GTK backends for the 304.137 driver.



Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides:
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd,
 libgl1-nvidia-glx,
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-304xx-glx,
 vdpau-driver,
 libglx-nvidia,
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — runtime libraries
 Every shared library from the NVIDIA 304.137 userspace: libGL / libGLX_nvidia
 / libEGL_nvidia, libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore,
 libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends, plus the GLX X extension module. Install the
 :i386 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 304.137 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-6.8.0-138-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-6.8.0-138-generic
Provides: nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-6.8.0-138-generic,
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304xx prebuilt module for Linux 6.8.0-138-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 304xx series,
 compiled for the 6.8.0-138-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
